   "pointers": [
    "/categories/M12/adverse_effects/2/statement"
   ],
   "text": "AE/2 'well tolerated by patients with minimal discomfort' — 내약성 서술이 adverse_effects 에 있다. patient_en 'Most people …'(비율 추가), ja 'ほとんどの方'."
