    "/categories/M12/adverse_effects/3/statement",
    "/categories/M12/adverse_effects/4/statement",
    "/categories/M12/adverse_effects/0/statement"
   ],
   "text": "AE/3 'Postinflammatory hyperpigmentation occurs after microneedling.'(단정·조건 없음)와 AE/0 'can occur, particularly in darker skin phototypes'(가능성·조건)는 같은 사건의 다른 수식. AE/4 'Erythema and edema follow microneedling treatments.'(시간 순서 'follow'). patient_en AE/4 'common reactions that resolve naturally'(빈도·경과 추가)."
  },
  {
